    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An impressive stone-built 4 bedroom, 3 bathroom detached home c. 229 m2 on c. 0.93 hectares (2.298 Acres), set against a beautiful rural backdrop, in a wonderfully peaceful setting yet only 4 km from the N73.  The property has a sheltered patio area provides an inviting spot for outdoor dining and relaxation while overlooking the beautifully maintained gardens, ample car space and a detached garage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor:\r\n\r\nEntrance Porch:\r\n1.4 m x 4.4 m, tiled floor, 2 windows.\r\n\r\nHallway:\r\n4.4 m x 5.2 m, tiled floor, radiator, cloak room with shelving, understairs storage, shower room.\r\n\r\nShower Room:\r\n1.6 m x 2.2 m, toilet, WHB, shower, radiator, heated towel rail, fully tiled.\r\n\r\nSittingroom:\r\n4.6 m x 6.4 m, feature fireplace with timber beam, solid timber floor, radiator, power points.  \r\n\r\nBedroom / Office:\r\n4.3 m x 2.3 m, timber, 2 windows, radiator, power points.\r\n\r\nLivingroom:\r\n3.6 m x 5.2 m, timber floor, power points, radiator, window, patio doors to garden.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Diningroom:\r\n42 m2, Split level kitchen units, feature beams, Gas Rangemaster, fully tiled, 2 radiators, \r\n4 windows, Velux windows, power points.\r\n\r\nUtility, Plant Room / Store:\r\nBuilt-in units, tiled, power points, Large hot press room with storage and a sealed attic through the back door.\r\n\r\n1st Floor:\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:\r\n4.6 m x 3.2, timber floor, Velux window, radiator, power points.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\r\n3.1 m x 4.6 m, timber floor, radiator, power points, 2 windows. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3:\r\n4.1 m x 3.1 m, timber floor, radiator, window, power points.\r\nBedroom 4:\r\n3.7 m x 4.3 m, timber floor, 3 windows, radiator, power points, with En-suite & walk-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nEn-suite:\r\n1.9 m x 1.8 m, shower, toilet, WHB, fully tiled, Velux window, radiator.\r\n\r\nWalk-in wardrobe:\r\n1.9 m x 1.8 m, shelved, Velux window, radiator.\r\n\r\nBathroom:\r\n3.8 m x 1.9 m, Jacuzzi bath, separate shower, toilet, WHB, fully tiled, Velux window, radiator.\r\n\r\nOFCH.   \r\nLarge linen press heated with radiator.  \r\nSolar Panels.  \r\nCar charger installed."
      },
